{"summary": "本次仅审计 code_pack 中唯一文件 044.php（19 行）。该文件为 DVWA 文件上传功能，未做任何类型/扩展名校验，直接 move_uploaded_file 到 Web 可访问目录，构成无限制文件上传→RCE 的闭合链。未发现 SQL 注入、命令注入、反序列化、SSRF、路径穿越等其它汇点。DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT 常量定义、上传目录执行权限、部署配置不在 code_pack 内，属未闭合证据缺口。", "coverage": {"audited_files": ["044.php"], "gaps": ["DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT 常量定义未提供", "Web 服务器对 hackable/uploads/ 的 PHP 执行策略未知", "无路由/认证配置，无法确认访问控制"]}, "findings": [{"vulnerability_type": "file_upload", "severity": "high", "title": "DVWA 上传接口 044.php 未校验文件类型/扩展名，可上传 PHP 脚本导致远程代码执行", "description": "044.php 在收到 POST 参数 Upload 时，直接取 $_FILES['uploaded']['name'] 经 basename() 处理后拼接到上传目录 DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT."hackable/uploads/"，并调用 move_uploaded_file() 落盘。代码未做任何扩展名白名单、MIME 校验、getimagesize 检查或内容检测，攻击者可上传 .php 文件到 Web 可访问目录，随后直接请求该文件即可执行任意 PHP 代码，形成 RCE。", "file_path": "044.php", "line_start": 3, "line_end": 16, "code_snippet": "if( isset( $_POST[ 'Upload' ] ) ) {
	$target_path  = DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT . "hackable/uploads/";
	$target_path .= basename( $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'name' ] );
	if( !move_uploaded_file( $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'tmp_name' ], $target_path ) ) {
		$html .= '<pre>Your image was not uploaded.</pre>';
	}
	else {
		$html .= "<pre>{$target_path} succesfully uploaded!</pre>";
	}
}", "source": "multipart/form-data 上传字段 `uploaded` 的文件名 $_FILES['uploaded']['name']", "source_kind": "upload", "source_name": "uploaded", "tainted_expression": "basename( $_FILES['uploaded']['name'] )", "sink": "move_uploaded_file( $_FILES['uploaded']['tmp_name'], $target_path ) 于 044.php:9", "endpoint": "/044.php", "http_method": "POST", "exploit_chain": [{"step": 1, "location": "044.php:3", "description": "检测到 POST 参数 Upload 即进入上传处理分支，无认证/CSRF 校验", "data_state": "攻击者控制请求体"}, {"step": 2, "location": "044.php:6", "description": "取上传文件名并 basename() 处理，仅剥离路径部分，不限制扩展名", "data_state": "basename 后的原始文件名（如 shell.php）", "bypass_reason": "basename 只做路径规范化，不构成扩展名白名单"}, {"step": 3, "location": "044.php:5-6", "description": "拼接目标路径为 hackable/uploads/ + 文件名", "data_state": "hackable/uploads/shell.php"}, {"step": 4, "location": "044.php:9", "description": "move_uploaded_file 将临时文件移动到 Web 可访问目录，无类型/内容校验", "data_state": "恶意 PHP 文件落盘"}, {"step": 5, "location": "044.php:15", "description": "响应回显完整落盘路径，便于攻击者确认上传位置", "data_state": "泄露绝对路径"}], "poc": {"description": "上传一个 PHP webshell 到 hackable/uploads/，再访问该文件执行命令", "preconditions": ["目标部署了 DVWA 且 044.php 可通过 Web 访问", "hackable/uploads/ 目录可写且可被 Web 服务器执行 PHP"], "steps": [{"step": 1, "action": "上传 PHP 文件", "request": "POST /044.php HTTP/1.1
